onedrive-cpp (0.10.20-1~ubuntu24.04) noble; urgency=medium

  * Expand the themed FTXUI experience with inspection dashboards, paged
    Drive views, scrollable partial-download results, and consistent
    navigation and exit behavior while preserving text and JSON output.
