onedrive-cpp (0.7.41-1~ubuntu24.04) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add durable, restart-safe uploads, large-file upload sessions, remote
    directory creation, and safe local/remote move and deletion handling.
  * Persist operation journals and filesystem identity, recover interrupted
    work safely, and apply conflict, quota, and selective-sync policies.
  * Add recursive filesystem monitoring with Graph polling, signal-aware
    shutdown, and concurrent uploads with aggregate rate limiting.
  * Strengthen SQLite integrity checks, transactional migrations, and
    typestate modeling for transfer and filesystem operations.

