onedrive-cpp (0.6.38-1~ubuntu24.04) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add resumable, integrity-checked range downloads, conditional requests,
    durable checkpoints, bounded concurrency, and aggregate rate limiting.
  * Add selective synchronization, safe conflict backups, single-file
    downloads, configurable proxies, and live Graph end-to-end testing.
  * Isolate state by account and Drive; harden private permissions, path
    handling, SQLite state, OAuth scopes, and remote deletion safety.
  * Improve file metadata handling, download validation and retries, and
    versioned configuration.

